Provenance notes:

* This package is a fork of https://github.com/Awu12277/dsh-stock-watch (MIT).
  The Tencent quote parsing, K-line column order, intraday previous-close
  derivation and the panel UI originate there.
* This package ships NO third-party skill or asset. The upstream release bundled
  two skills (Anthropic's "frontend-design" and the "investment-research" skill)
  and injected them into ~/.agents/skills on first run; both the files and that
  behaviour were removed here, so nothing but the original code is redistributed.
* data/ contains plain A-share / ETF / Hong Kong code-and-name lists used for
  offline symbol search. Quote data itself is fetched live and never bundled.
